                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-42889**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | commons-text  | 1.9  | 1.10.0  | java-archive  | /web/pom.xml  | github:language:java  | [CVE-2022-42889](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-599f-7c49-w659)  |\n"
